== Trivia ==
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', The Pinking Shears were unlocked by dying 100 times. In Rebirth, this unlocks {{i|Scissors}} instead.
* Pinking shears are shears with a serrated blade and are used for cutting canvas.
* {{dlc|nr}} Isaac's headless body looks similar to a {{e|Pacer}}.
* {{dlc|r}} The body shares the same appearance as Isaac's body but with blood gushing from the top, similar to a {{e|Gusher}}.

